'' A CONSTRUCTOR ANOTHER MODULE DEFINES, called as 'dim as T x = T( ... )', is declared
'' from its DECLARED parameters. LowerCtorInit built the declaration from the argument
'' types instead, so a byref parameter came out as its pointee: 'byref w as wstring' was
'' 'void' -- 'declare void _ZN3CBR1TC1EiRwi(ptr, i32, void, i32)' -- and clang refused
'' the module. pkg/sys's CGraphCtx (sys/win/gui) is the shape: a byref wstring with a default.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc -i tests/modules/src/ctorbyref/libs tests/modules/src/ctorbyref/app/main.tiko -o tests/modules/ctorbyreflink.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: void type only allowed
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/modules/ctorbyreflink.exe
'' RUN: tests/modules/ctorbyreflink.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  221
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  423
